	SNA		/OTHER ERRORS
	JMP CRET	/OK, LEAVE
	 
/8E ERROR ROUTINE
/FIRST CHECK FOR SEEK FAILED OR CYLINDER
/ADDRESS ERROR. MUST RECAL FOR THESE
BAD8E,	AND K1002	/NOTE AC RAL
	SNA CLA
	JMP TRY3	/OTHER ERROR
/RECAL AND RETRY 3X
	DCLR		/CLR STATUS
	STL RTL		/AC=2
	DCLR		/RECAL
	DSKP		/WAIT FOR DONE
	 JMP .-1
	 
